      "comment": "Luonnotar: Columbina and Luonnotar",
      "content": "Columbina, once called the Damselette, brought Luonnotar into being by giving up a piece of her own soul. She did so in the past, to leave an anchor in the present and a guide for the Traveler, with the instruction to lead them to the garden of Moon-Prayer Blossoms where \"a little lost dove\" would need their help. After Columbina returned, Luonnotar vanished; Columbina then recreated her, freeing her from the need to carry her spirit.",
