      "comment": "Luonnotar: Kuuhenki and the Moon Goddess",
      "content": "Kuuhenki are Nod-Krai's pure elemental lifeforms, regarded as the Moon Goddess Kuutar's familiars. Legend says they appeared at her birth on Hiisi Island and wove the moonlight into her garments. A luonnotar is a particularly rare kuuhenki that appears from the Moon Goddess's blessing and is thought to bring fortune. The general lore is told by Lauma in Where the Moon Rises; Luonnotar herself turns out to have a different origin.",
